# Project groups for tabrail. Copy to groups.conf next to tabrail.tmux, or point the tmux option
# @tabrail_groups at a file of your own. A new tab joins the first group one of whose folders it was
# opened in or below; prefix M, a drag or the right-click menu moves it. Tabs in none: Default. The
# menu's "New group…" adds lines here; dragging a group's row in the sidebar reorders them. Columns:
# name (one word), tint behind the group's row, icon, folders (optional; a new tab of the group
# opens in the first).
Website   #283147  ◆  ~/src/website ~/src/website-staging
Infra     #3b2f2a  ▲  ~/src/infra
Notes     #2a3b2f  ●
